# ---- TailWater: what stays on the laptop ----
# Cited documents (third-party; see sources/SOURCES.md for where to get each)
sources/*
!sources/SOURCES.md
# Independent review artifacts (kept locally as a record, not part of the reproducible package)
verification/
# Manuscript, cover letter and explainer: under double-blind review, not posted publicly until published
paper/submission/
paper/*.docx
paper/*.pdf
# Scratch
_to_delete/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
~$*

# Fonts are not redistributable
fonts/*
!fonts/README.md
